Marquis Cooper...

1625
01:52:21,169 --> 01:52:24,215
Garis 39 yard, Corey Smith.

1626
01:52:25,260 --> 01:52:28,393
Dengan tekel, Corey Smith...

1627
01:52:38,403 --> 01:52:40,710
